From: shaurizard <contact@nyoom.engineering>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 20:45:48 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 34/34] rexglue: add vfs-dump to extract an STFS package

src/filesystem/vfs_dump.cpp, Xenia's xenia-vfs-dump, came over without
its console app (a TODO) and is in no target, so nothing in the SDK
extracts a package's files to a folder, which a project that generates
code from a title update needs: the update ships as an STFS package.

Make it the CLI subcommand `rexglue vfs-dump <source> <dump_path>`,
with the source and destination as arguments instead of cvars, and
errors (no package, a file it cannot read or write) as a failed command
instead of skipped files. Files are read through File::ReadSync into one
reused buffer.

Co-authored-by: factory-droid[bot] <138933559+factory-droid[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
